# Outbound copy is not published here.
#
# Measured 2026-09-09: every markdown file in this repo except the root README.md was
# returning 200 as text/markdown on poidhz.com. That included drafts that had never been
# sent - docs/owed-credit.md, which says what credit the programme owes and to whom, and
# rounds/r5/winner-announce.md, naming a winner who had not yet been told. "Drafted, never
# sent" turned out to mean "published, just not posted to social", which is not what the
# phrase implied to anyone using it. Zaal asked for them out of the served tree.
#
# The rule is by SHAPE, not by a list of filenames, so a draft written next week is covered
# the moment it is created rather than when someone remembers to add it. Outbound copy in
# this repo lives in exactly three shapes and all three are excluded, sent or unsent -
# deciding per-file which had gone out is the judgement call that lets one slip.
#
# These files stay in git. They are working files for the people running the programme, and
# the repo is public on GitHub - this stops poidhz.com serving them as if they were pages,
# it is not a secrecy control. Nothing in them is secret; some of it is simply not ours to
# publish before the person named in it has been told.
#
# scripts/check-site-claims.py enforces this: it fails if a file carrying a SEND-GATE marker
# or declaring itself unsent is not matched here. Verified in production after deploying -
# the paths 404 rather than 200.

# ONE LEVEL DEEP WAS NOT ENOUGH, found live 2026-09-26. `rounds/*/winner-announce.md` matched
# rounds/r5/ and did NOT match rounds/daily/d01/, because the daily ladder is one directory
# further down. Measured: rounds/daily/d01/winner-announce.md returned 200 on poidhz.com - an
# unsent announcement naming a winner, servable - while rounds/r5/winner-announce.md correctly
# 404d. Same shallow-glob shape as the closeout sweep fixed the same night. Both depths are
# listed now rather than one pattern trusted to cover a tree that grew.
rounds/*/cast-templates/
rounds/*/*/cast-templates/
rounds/*/promo-cast.md
rounds/*/*/promo-cast.md
rounds/*/winner-announce.md
rounds/*/*/winner-announce.md

# ANNOUNCE.md and FEEDBACK.md are outbound copy too - the promo blocks for a round and the
# drafted replies to its entrants. Neither shape existed when this file was written, and both
# were servable: d04 and d05's ANNOUNCE.md both returned 200.
rounds/*/ANNOUNCE.md
rounds/*/*/ANNOUNCE.md
rounds/*/FEEDBACK.md
rounds/*/*/FEEDBACK.md
rounds/*/REVIEW.md
rounds/*/*/REVIEW.md
rounds/r6/kenny-note.md
rounds/r7/retainer-outreach.md
docs/owed-credit.md
docs/weekend-post.md
docs/launch-post.md
docs/outreach/

# Not site content either - working notes and local session bundles.
.handoffs/
